# LeakSanitizer (Linux ASan builds of compiler/tests/leaks): the epoch collector's deferred-free stack
# (native/gc/zig common.object.PtrStack, grown by rt_gc_free_later) is not released at exit. It is collector
# bookkeeping, not program objects (those are counted by --leak-check); see the PR notes.
leak:common.object.PtrStack.grow
